# Hexagonal Prism and Eraser Material

newmtl YellowHexagon
Kd 1.0 1.0 0.0  # Yellow diffuse color
Ks 0.1 0.1 0.1  # Subtle specular highlight
Ns 10             # Specular exponent

newmtl PinkEraser
Kd 1.0 0.7 0.7  # Pink diffuse color
Ks 0.1 0.1 0.1  # Subtle specular highlight
Ns 10             # Specular exponent

newmtl SilverBand
Kd 0.8 0.8 0.8 # Silver color
Ks 0.3 0.3 0.3
Ns 20

newmtl WoodCone
Kd 0.8 0.6 0.4 # Tan wood color
Ks 0.05 0.05 0.05
Ns 5